<title>USA: Omaha hogs $1.50/2.00 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha hogs $1.50/2.00 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $1.50-2.00 lower. Top $58.25 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US  1-3    220-260 lbs    58.00-58.25</p>
<p>US  2-3    260-280 lbs    57.00-57.50</p>
<p>Sows: 20 percent. Uneven, mostly 1.00 lower. Top 49.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3     350-450 lbs    46.00-46.50</p>
<p>	     450-500 lbs    47.00</p>
<p>US 2-3     500-650 lbs    48.50-49.00</p>
</text>
